Relevant columns for the task  
• `date`: filter to July‑2017 sessions (`BETWEEN '20170701' AND '20170731'`).  
• `fullVisitorId`: identifies the customer; lets us collect all of a customer’s purchases.  
• `hits.item.productName`: the name of each product purchased inside a session (via UNNEST).  
• `hits.item.itemQuantity`: quantity of a product bought in that hit (to measure “top‑selling”).  
• `hits.item.itemRevenue`: revenue of a product in that hit (alternative “top‑selling” metric).  
• (optional) `hits.eCommerceAction.action_type`: value = 6 marks a completed purchase.

Typical conditions  
• `LOWER(hits.item.productName) LIKE '%henley%'` (find the item).  
• `hits.eCommerceAction.action_type = 6` (keep only completed purchases).  
• `date BETWEEN '20170701' AND '20170731'` (restrict to July 2017).  
• `hits.item.productName <> 'YouTube Men’s Vintage Henley'` (exclude the focal sku).

Below are ten step‑by‑step exploratory queries (each different, all LIMITED 20) that gradually build toward the final answer.

```sql
-- 1. Peek at a few product names in July‑2017 purchases
SELECT DISTINCT hits.item.productName
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_201707*`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h,
     UNNEST(h.item) AS item
WHERE item.productName IS NOT NULL
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Find sessions where the Vintage Henley was bought in July‑2017
SELECT DISTINCT fullVisitorId, date, item.itemQuantity
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_201707*`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h,
     UNNEST(h.item) AS item
WHERE LOWER(item.productName) LIKE '%vintage%henley%'
  AND h.eCommerceAction.action_type = 6
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. List all customers (visitors) who bought the Vintage Henley in July‑2017
SELECT DISTINCT fullVisitorId
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_201707*`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h,
     UNNEST(h.item) AS item
WHERE item.productName = 'YouTube Men’s Vintage Henley'
  AND h.eCommerceAction.action_type = 6
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Show *other* items these same customers bought in July‑2017 (no Henley)
